<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-πέμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send back an answer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.114
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέμψασιν ἀντέπεμψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					306
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>send back</i> sound, <i>echo,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.3.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>send in requital</i> or <i>repayment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκούρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					542
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ θηρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philem.
					47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>send against,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιάν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.99
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>send in the place of</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγοὺς ἐπὶ τὰς ναῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.54
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
